{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, approach it, take it if close, check it, perform task, scan area. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectClose    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />\"",
